<gco:CharacterString>Keith, A., Reinsch, S., Cagnarini, C., Emmett, B.A., Cosby, B.J. (2023). Earthworm species identification and counts at three long-term grassland-to-woodland land use contrasts across England. NERC EDS Environmental Information Data Centre 10.5285/2636c7e1-ec8c-4b77-9f4e-f731781191ca</gco:CharacterString>
