<gmd:lineage>
<gmd:LI_Lineage>
<gmd:statement><gco:CharacterString>Earthworm measurements were conducted in grids 2 and 5. The earthworms were counted in 25 cm x 25 cm x 25 cm soil cubes in grids 2 and 5. The earthworms were stored in the fridge until identified to species level in the lab. Earthworms were identified by a competent member of staff, and earthworm keys were used as additional resource. Earthworm counts were recorded on paper in the field and transferred to Microsoft Excel. Earthworm species numbers were recorded in a lab-book and transferred to the same Microsoft Excel. The file was then converted to csv.</gco:CharacterString></gmd:statement>
</gmd:LI_Lineage>
